  "defect_observations": [
    "thm:p15-changing-conditional-limits (body 188) asserts |Y|<=Z a.s.; the annex (307-349) uses it implicitly (ordinary dominated convergence, line 318-319) but never writes the one-line derivation (limit of |Y_n|<=Z). Editorial; not counted as missing text.",
    "annex:p15.ui-conditional-family lines 95-97: the closing sentence about convergence of event probabilities and pointwise convergence of indicators is a stray remark unrelated to the proof just given; candidate for removal.",
    "thm:p15-submartingale-ui (body 117-120) adds X_n <= E(X_inf|F_n), which is not part of source Thm 4.6.4; it is proved (annex 212-222) but carries no source attribution, which is consistent (no cite on that entry).",
    "thm:p15-ui-counterexamples item 3 reparametrizes source Ex. 4.6.11 (Y_n, Z_n with P(Z_n=n)=1/n) as B_n and nC_n; equivalent, and body 217 names the source example."
